              "fill": "#202020",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "A 3% nominal annual rate effective 1 November is an unsaved example. Payout frequency is independent of that rate. Missing payout timing, day count, balance timing, capitalization or rounding prevents a meaningful estimate. Unknown/effective rate bases are not silently treated as nominal.",
